const e='---\ntitle: CryptoBar – macOS Menu Bar Cryptocurrency Tracker\ndate: 2025-11-06\ndescription: A lightweight, open-source macOS menu bar app for real-time cryptocurrency price tracking. Privacy-focused, no telemetry, built with Swift/SwiftUI.\nauthor: "cmalf"\nimage: /assets/img/Post/cryptobar/cryptobar.webp\n---\n\n![CryptoBar Preview](/assets/img/Post/cryptobar/cryptobar.webp)\n\n# CryptoBar – Real-Time Cryptocurrency Tracker for macOS Menu Bar\n\nCryptoBar is a minimalist menu bar application that displays live cryptocurrency prices directly in your macOS menu bar.\n\nBuilt with Swift/SwiftUI, fully open-source under GNU GPL v3, and completely privacy-focused (no tracking, no telemetry).\n\n### Key Features\n\n- Live price ticker in the menu bar (primary coin)\n- Popover with full watchlist + 24h change (green/red indicators)\n- Support for up to 30 coins (by symbol or CoinGecko ID)\n- 15+ fiat currencies\n- Custom refresh interval (10 seconds to 5 minutes)\n- Pinable price list window\n- Launch at login\n- Built-in auto-updater\n- Right-click menu for quick access\n- Anonymous public API usage (cryptobubbles.net)\n\n![CryptoBar Preview](/assets/img/Post/cryptobar/cryptobar-view.webp)\n\n### Download & Source\n\n- Latest release: [GitHub Releases](https://github.com/Cmalf-Labs/CryptoBar/releases)\n- Source code: [github.com/Cmalf-Labs/CryptoBar](https://github.com/Cmalf-Labs/CryptoBar)\n\nInstallation: Download the `.dmg` from releases, drag to Applications folder.\n\nContributions, bug reports, and feature requests are welcome.\n';export{e as default};
